  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "No matter what world you go to on standalone, you are greeted with horrible flickery visuals everywhere. The severity differs with the distance from the world origin but it has been like this for a very long time now. This sor of issue is dangerous for anyone who plays standalone with epilepsy or photosensitivity as well as just headache inducing for players without. The textures just completely freak out and clip all the time and it makes the game unbearable at times, especially with it affecting the menus also.",
